`--tier global` reads `{home_dir}/_specs/` — `home_dir` defaults to `~/Claude/` — and needs no
attached project.

-- fixtures/xdg/booping/config.yaml --
core:
  specs:
    tiers:
      global:
        namespace: owner
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_specs/rule/0001-keep-it-short.md --
---
type: rule
title: Keep it short
summary: Cut what the reader does not need.
status: accepted
---
-- cmd --
booping specs ls --tier global
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
rule/0001  accepted  Cut what the reader does not need.
